    "  tax rate 0.0625    PERCENT, HALF_UP, isDefault",
    "The seeded tokens are readable strings a human types into curl; minted tokens are JWT-shaped.",
    "Token expirations are stamped at hydrate from the configured TTL (19168 s, the documented example).",
    "config_modified_ms is the fixed instant every config entity reports to a lastModified filter."
